===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|фи́га}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-фи́га.ogg}}

===Etymology 1===
[[Image:Some figs.jpg|thumb|фига]]
Per Vasmer, probably borrowed from {{bor|ru|pl|figa}}, from {{der|ru|gmh|vîge}}, from {{der|ru|goh|fîga}}, from {{der|ru|la|fīcus||[[fig]]}}. The rude gesture has the same origin, and is known as the "fig sign" in English.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|фи́га|adj=фи́говый}}

# [[fig]] (fruit, wood, or tree)
#: {{syn|ru|инжи́р|ви́нная я́года|сми́рнская я́года|смоко́вница|смо́ква}}
# a [[rude]] [[gesture]], in which the [[hand]] is in the form of a [[fist]] with the [[thumb]] placed between the [[index finger|index]] and [[middle finger|middle]] [[finger]]s
#: {{syn|ru|шиш|ду́ля|фиг|ку́киш}}

